      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Reader, I Married Him"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_school",
      "text": "You open a small school for girls on your inheritance. You teach them, among other things, that a small plain girl can refuse a wrong life and find a right one.",
